A thousand years before, Psalm twenty-two recorded

4
00:00:06,981 --> 00:00:09,142
how the Messiah would be mocked — the gestures,

5
00:00:09,582 --> 00:00:10,082
and the words.

6
00:00:10,102 --> 00:00:13,063
"...they shake the head, saying, He trusted

7
00:00:13,183 --> 00:00:16,163
on the LORD that he would deliver him: let

8
00:00:16,203 --> 00:00:18,064
him deliver him..." At the cross, Matthew's

9
00:00:18,084 --> 00:00:20,384
