10
00:00:20,404 --> 00:00:22,725
their heads, the rulers sneering nearly line

11
00:00:22,765 --> 00:00:26,486
for line: "He trusted in God; let him deliver

12
00:00:26,526 --> 00:00:29,446
him now, if he will have him: for he said,

13
00:00:30,246 --> 00:00:32,487
I am the Son of God." They thought they were

14
